keywords:
  - publish-subscribe
  - semantic-routing
  - ai-agents
  - model-context-protocol
  - event-driven-architecture
  - specification
abstract: >-
  An open specification for publish/subscribe that routes each message by what it
  means: a free topic match first, then embedding similarity, then an AI judge only
  for unsure cases, under token budgets, with every decision audited and replayable.
